## Complete Block Example

```liquid
{% liquid
  assign abd_theme = block.settings.abd_theme
  assign custom_bg = block.settings.custom_bg
  assign custom_text = block.settings.custom_text
%}

<div class="block-example {% if abd_theme != blank %}abd-theme-{{ abd_theme }}{% endif %}"
     style="{% if custom_bg != blank %}background-color: {{ custom_bg }};{% endif %} {% if custom_text != blank %}color: {{ custom_text }};{% endif %}"
     {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- if abd_theme == 'retro' -%}<div class="abd-geocities-box">{%- endif -%}
  {%- if abd_theme == 'social' -%}<div class="abd-myspace-container">{%- endif -%}
  
  {%- if block.settings.heading != blank -%}
    <div class="block-example__heading abd-title">{{ block.settings.heading }}</div>
  {%- endif -%}
  
  {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
    <div class="block-example__text abd-content">{{ block.settings.text }}</div>
  {%- endif -%}
  
  {%- if abd_theme == 'social' -%}</div>{%- endif -%}
  {%- if abd_theme == 'retro' -%}</div>{%- endif -%}
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Example Block",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "Text"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "ABD Theme Styles"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "abd_theme",
      "label": "ABD Theme Style",
      "default": "",
      "options": [
        { "value": "", "label": "None (Theme Default)" },
        { "value": "premium", "label": "Premium Modern" },
        { "value": "classified", "label": "Classified Document" },
        { "value": "historical", "label": "Historical Parchment" },
        { "value": "social", "label": "MySpace Heritage" },
        { "value": "retro", "label": "90s Web (Geocities)" },
        { "value": "culinaria", "label": "Culinaria (Vintage Recipe)" },
        { "value": "diary", "label": "Editorial Chic (Journal)" },
        { "value": "briefing", "label": "Intelligence Briefing" },
        { "value": "zine", "label": "Campus Zine (Brutalist)" },
        { "value": "portrait", "label": "Biographical Portrait" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "custom_bg",
      "label": "Custom Background Color"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "custom_text",
      "label": "Custom Text Color"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
```

## Notes

- Always place the theme settings after block-specific settings, separated by a header
- Use semantic classes (`.abd-title`, `.abd-content`) for theme styling to work properly
- The retro theme uses `.abd-geocities-box` wrapper
- The social theme uses `.abd-myspace-container` wrapper
- Custom colors override theme defaults but work alongside theme styles
